# {{ app_naam }}

Dit project is gegenereerd met **AppCreator CLI** en geoptimaliseerd voor **Google Antigravity** en AI-assisted development.

## 🚀 Snelle Start

{% if backend == "fastapi" %}
### Backend (FastAPI)
```bash
cd backend
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # Op Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```
API documentatie is direct beschikbaar op: `http://localhost:8000/docs` en health status op `http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health`.
{% endif %}

{% if frontend == "vue3" %}
### Frontend (Vue 3 + Vite + Tailwind + Shadcn)
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```
Applicatie opent op: `http://localhost:5173`
{% endif %}

{% if hardware == "esp32" %}
### Embedded Firmware (ESP32)
```bash
pio run --target upload
pio device monitor -b 115200
```
{% endif %}

{% if database == "postgres" %}
### Docker Compose
Start de database (en eventuele services) met:
```bash
docker compose up -d
```
{% endif %}

